        <div class="story-feat-item active" data-idx="0"><div class="story-feat-bg" style="--bg:linear-gradient(160deg,#5a1008,#1a0402)"><div class="ph-img"><div class="ph-img-label"><strong>[ 鍋島直正と反射炉 ]</strong>写真を配置</div></div></div><div class="story-feat-body"><div class="story-feat-cat"><div class="story-feat-cat-dot" style="background:var(--c-bakumatsu)"></div><span class="story-feat-cat-label">幕末維新 · 1850</span></div><h3 class="story-feat-title">鍋島直正と反射炉<br/>— 佐賀藩の近代化戦略</h3><p class="story-feat-desc">幕末、佐賀藩主・鍋島直正は日本で初めて反射炉の建造に成功した。西洋の冶金技術を独力で習得し、大砲鋳造を実現した「幕末の科学者藩主」の全貌。</p><div class="story-feat-meta">テーマ：テクノロジー · ものづくり · 挑戦</div><a href="#" class="story-feat-link">記事を読む <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a></div></div>
        <div class="story-feat-item" data-idx="1"><div class="story-feat-bg" style="--bg:linear-gradient(160deg,#8a6020,#3a2008)"><div class="ph-img"><div class="ph-img-label"><strong>[ 有田焼 ]</strong>写真を配置</div></div></div><div class="story-feat-body"><div class="story-feat-cat"><div class="story-feat-cat-dot" style="background:var(--c-edo)"></div><span class="story-feat-cat-label">佐賀藩（江戸）· 1616</span></div><h3 class="story-feat-title">有田焼の成立と展開</h3><p class="story-feat-desc">泉山磁石場の発見から始まった磁器革命。なぜ佐賀の山から世界へ渡る陶磁器が生まれたのか。李参平伝承の虚実と、藩による産業統制の全貌。</p><div class="story-feat-meta">テーマ：ものづくり · アート · 貿易</div><a href="#" class="story-feat-link">記事を読む <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a></div></div>
        <div class="story-feat-item" data-idx="2"><div class="story-feat-bg" style="--bg:linear-gradient(160deg,#2a4010,#0c1806)"><div class="ph-img"><div class="ph-img-label"><strong>[ 吉野ヶ里遺跡 ]</strong>写真を配置</div></div></div><div class="story-feat-body"><div class="story-feat-cat"><div class="story-feat-cat-dot" style="background:var(--c-yayoi)"></div><span class="story-feat-cat-label">弥生 · BC 100</span></div><h3 class="story-feat-title">吉野ヶ里遺跡<br/>— 弥生の環濠集落</h3><p class="story-feat-desc">2,000年以上前、佐賀平野に巨大な環濠集落が栄えた。国防・まちづくり・くらしの原点。発掘成果が示す弥生社会の実像とは。</p><div class="story-feat-meta">テーマ：まちづくり · 国防 · くらし</div><a href="#" class="story-feat-link">記事を読む <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a></div></div>
        <div class="story-feat-item" data-idx="3"><div class="story-feat-bg" style="--bg:linear-gradient(160deg,#5a1010,#200404)"><div class="ph-img"><div class="ph-img-label"><strong>[ 龍造寺隆信 ]</strong>写真を配置</div></div></div><div class="story-feat-body"><div class="story-feat-cat"><div class="story-feat-cat-dot" style="background:var(--c-ryuzoji)"></div><span class="story-feat-cat-label">龍造寺氏 · 1570</span></div><h3 class="story-feat-title">龍造寺隆信の<br/>肥前統一戦</h3><p class="story-feat-desc">農民出身から九州の覇者へ。「肥前の熊」と恐れられた隆信の逆転劇。今山の戦いと沖田畷——勝利と敗北の全記録。</p><div class="story-feat-meta">テーマ：権力闘争 · サバイバル · 逆転劇</div><a href="#" class="story-feat-link">記事を読む <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a></div></div>
        <div class="story-feat-item" data-idx="4"><div class="story-feat-bg" style="--bg:linear-gradient(160deg,#1a2840,#060e18)"><div class="ph-img"><div class="ph-img-label"><strong>[ 葉隠 ]</strong>写真を配置</div></div></div><div class="story-feat-body"><div class="story-feat-cat"><div class="story-feat-cat-dot" style="background:var(--c-edo)"></div><span class="story-feat-cat-label">佐賀藩（江戸）· 1716</span></div><h3 class="story-feat-title">葉隠<br/>— 武士の哲学書が生まれた理由</h3><p class="story-feat-desc">「武士道といふは死ぬ事と見つけたり」。江戸中期の佐賀藩でなぜこの書が生まれたのか。山本常朝の思想と、藩政の時代背景から読み解く。</p><div class="story-feat-meta">テーマ：くらし · 思想 · 武士</div><a href="#" class="story-feat-link">記事を読む <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a></div></div>
